  "scope": "Native transport observations pass 683 tests in 67 files, types/build, all 215 actual source desktop checks with normal close and two fresh corrupt-file startup cases. Four edited-history sends show actual owned-loopback POST/HTTP 200 header traces under unchanged completion and request-count conditions. Separate component evidence captures a deliberately closed connection with actual UND_ERR_SOCKET; it does not establish the prior hosted failure cause. Large restored-workspace project reads, real PowerShell 7, original model deadlines, independent failures/stops and eleven comparison requests remain verified. Two fresh project images are individually inspected and all three compiled assets exactly match the prior verified source/application body. Fresh matching runtime records under the instrumented suite, hosted acceptance and remaining capability/UI scope are pending."
